	<row id="msg_0555_T21R0501_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ain’t nobody invite you in!\nTouch my TV and it’s over.\rHomies get experience from scraps\nand glow up. Like me after my divorce.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0555_T21R0501_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How’d you even get in here?!\nI keep a bat by the door, bro.\rI heard every homie got its own\nnature, and it mess with their stats!\rMy nature is “Lazy.” Doctor confirmed.\n</language>
